WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.850
Now, everyone.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.640
As the battle on Lantau Island...

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.600
...approaches its climax...

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:31.650
...Sai Saici...

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.110
...Argo Gulskii...

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.110
Chibodee Crocket...

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.450
...and George de Sand...

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.570
Members of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.030
...have each fought against the
Four Kings of the Devil Gundam...

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.540
...and have fallen one by one.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:46.750
That's right.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:51.000
All so that Domon can fight
against the Devil Gundam.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.000
And today...

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.510
...one of the great mysteries
of this story...

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.010
...about the tragedy of
Schwarz and Kyoji...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.050
...will be revealed.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.180
And now!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:03.350
Gundam Fight!

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.720
Ready! Go!

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:11.810
Schwarz Rests in Grace!
Domon's Tearful Attack

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.240
Stop, Allenby!

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.370
Th-that's...

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:26.950
The Rising Gundam?!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.370
But just who's inside it?!

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.210
Allenby!

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.800
Your guard's down!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:46.010
Have you forgotten
you're in a battle ring?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.980
Or were you beaten down
so badly by the four kings...

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.390
...that you haven't the will to get up?!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.610
I've managed to make it this far
with the help of the others!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.530
I won't put to waste the
aspirations of my friends!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.030
I will defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:05.700
What are you babbling about,
you...?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.540
No! That's the spirit!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.330
Are you all right, Domon?!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.710
That voice...!

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.170
Schwarz has returned?
Not again!

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.550
Right!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:22.010
I will not let you get your
hands on my brother!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.510
"My brother"?

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.550
Then you really are Kyoji!

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.270
Sorry to worry you, Domon.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.180
My big brother...

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:36.940
Bastards!

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:40.280
It's one nuisance after another!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.820
Allenby!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.240
Where did Allenby go?!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.530
What are you waiting for?

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.450
Hurry and break free
from that Gundam...

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:54.040
...and return to the Devil Gundam
on Lantau Island.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:56.750
As Devil Allenby!

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:08.680
Wh-what is it?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.520
Wh-why, this is...

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.350
This can't be!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.030
You can't be serious, Allenby.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:32.290
You've been contaminated
by DG cells?

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:38.840
Allenby!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.430
As I thought.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:50.050
You're exactly who
I believed you were.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:52.470
Explain this to me, Kyoji!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:53.890
I will later!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.850
Right now the priority is to
defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.730
Leave Master to me!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.980
Think you can beat me?!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.660
Kyoji!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.240
What're you doing?!

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.120
Destroy the Devil Gundam, now!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.790
But what about your injuries?!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.920
Don't worry about me.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.250
Hurry up and go!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.170
All right.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.840
Go if you really want to,
you fool.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:27.220
Go and see for yourself.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.300
See the true state
of your brother!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.440
Wh-what's this?

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:39.900
My brother...

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.230
There're two of them?!

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.940
How could this be?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:56.900
Domon!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.500
See that?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:02.090
Your brother is practically dead!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.250
This is the damage caused
when you defeated...

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.170
...the Devil Gundam
in the Guyana Highlands!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.930
Damage?!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.260
If the pilot is in this state...

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:14.390
...the Devil Gundam is
only good for scrap iron.

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:16.640
You're the answer, Domon.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.020
You are destined to be
the new pilot...

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.770
...and lead the Devil Gundam
to a full recovery!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:22.990
No way!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.730
Master Asia!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.570
Consider it a selfless offering
to your brother!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.620
There will be no need for that.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.040
Master East, thank you
for your assistance.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.160
What do you mean?

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:44.790
The Devil Gundam...

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.720
This is insane.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.680
Wong, what's the big idea?

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:00.140
Kyoji's life is hanging
by a thread.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:02.230
Unless we have another pilot...

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.860
...the Devil Gundam will
never fully recover!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.690
Not necessarily.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.320
If, for a short period of time...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.900
...the Devil Gundam can be
operated without a pilot.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.370
Long enough to destroy you,
anyway.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.740
How dare you, Wong!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:30.920
Master East.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.890
You must realize that you're
nothing but an old man.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:40.680
Undefeated of the East,
what's going on?!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.440
That Wong has finally
revealed his true intention.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:47.520
However, I'm not about
to allow him to use...

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.150
...the Devil Gundam
for his petty ambitions.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.440
The Devil Gundam is...

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.450
The Devil Gundam is...

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.160
Damn!
Why? At a time like this?

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.540
Stop it!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.590
Allenby, listen to me!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.140
Allenby!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:19.470
Domon is desperately fighting
the Devil Gundam right now!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.270
Shut up!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:26.730
Domon's doing everything he can.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:31.480
If you communicated your soul
to Domon using your fists...

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:34.240
...you mustn't allow the
DG cells to control you!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.990
Domon... Domon!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.140
Where is Domon?!

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.340
Don't you leave me all
alone like this.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.330
Because I...

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:51.090
I love Domon, too!

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:53.840
Allenby...

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.050
You are...

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.850
Master East...

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:02.310
I have decided to
take your advice...

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.140
...to replace the old pilot with a
new one for the Devil Gundam.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.060
After we've gotten rid of
all this riff-raff...

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.070
...I will make use of
Allenby Beardsley.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.660
D-Domon...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.200
Kyoji!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.460
Brother, it's no good.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.420
You need treatment now.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.170
No, I'm okay.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:37.050
But...

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.090
More importantly...

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:40.390
Strike Kyoji down.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:44.060
Unless you strike Kyoji...

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.930
...you shall never defeat
the Devil Gundam!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.390
B-but...

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:51.520
I don't understand why
you're asking me to do this!

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:52.860
I mean...

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.230
Why are there two of you?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.990
What's going on here?

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.450
Kyoji!

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.120
Very well.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.910
I'll tell you everything.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:09.870
Listen...

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:13.290
I am Kyoji, and I am not Kyoji.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:16.090
I'm his mirror image.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.300
Mirror image?

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.260
That's right.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.990
The body and the soul have been
separated into two.

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:25.970
I'm like Kyoji's reflection
appearing in the mirror.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.780
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:39.950
That's right.
A reflection in the mirror.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:41.360
Because...

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.700
I am nothing but...

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.260
...a copy of Kyoji made of DG cells.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.210
What do you mean?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:55.150
It was all aimed at exterminating
the Devil Gundam.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:56.920
No way!

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.430
I heard that Kyoji planned to
use it to conquer the universe.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.890
That isn't true!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:07.170
The purpose of the Devil Gundam
was to regenerate the Earth.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:08.600
Regenerate the Earth?

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.810
Yes.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.020
Father's theoretical abilities
of the Ultimate Gundam...

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.190
...self-recover...

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.570
...self-multiply...

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:16.730
...and self-evolve...

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.320
...were intended to help
resurrect Planet Earth.

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.200
But...

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.580
There were those who wanted
that great power.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.040
<i>Kyoji!</i>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.120
<i>Hurry up and go!</i>

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:34.830
<i>We can't let the military</i>
<i>use this for evil!</i>

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.800
I leapt into the
Ultimate Gundam...

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.340
...and escaped to Earth.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.640
But the landing impact had caused
the computer to malfunction!

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.610
And then...

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:07.490
...it transformed itself into
the terrifying Devil Gundam.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.330
Then...

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.040
What about the claim that
Kyoji stole it?

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.460
A lie thought up by
Dr. Mikamura and Ulube.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.300
That's right.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:24.300
It was caused by my jealousy.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.890
I have done something foolish.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.350
No way...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.140
I can't believe...

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.520
...I spent a whole year...

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.060
...chasing after you.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.480
You were deceived into
becoming a Gundam Fighter...

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.860
...because they figured
you would go after Kyoji.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.410
But your opponent was
the terrifying Devil Gundam.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.740
I figured you would
push too hard.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.670
And Kyoji, trapped
within the Devil Gundam...

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.740
...and his consciousness fading...

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.920
...took over the defeated
Neo Germany's Fighter...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.680
...and created me by transferring
every aspect of his personality.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.050
And this is what he said.

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:08.720
"Please."

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.560
"You shall become
my reflection..."

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.180
"...and protect Domon for me."

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.100
Then why?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.350
Why didn't you tell me
when we first met?

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:24.260
You were so hotheaded, you
wouldn't have believed me.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.910
Besides, as long as our
father's life was at stake...

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:32.120
...it was important that you win
the Gundam Fight, at all costs.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.490
So I had to be very careful.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:36.330
Kyoji...

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:37.710
Domon...

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:39.170
It was...

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:41.630
It was really tough for me, too!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.710
Kyoji!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.090
You are my brother.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.000
There's no mistake!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.350
You're my brother!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.240
I never knew such things happened.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.400
However...

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.700
...none of that matters anymore.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.520
After all, the Devil Gundam will...

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.330
Wh-what's the matter?!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.120
Prime Minister Wong!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.660
Two Gundams nearby!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:17.910
What do you mean?!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.090
Allenby!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.630
Are you under someone's control?!

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.350
Domon!

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:37.350
Where is Domon?!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.300
Allenby!

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.620
What are you doing?!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.330
Hurry up and get rid of
that Gundam!

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:05.420
Berserker Full Mode!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.260
Stop it!

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.680
This isn't at all like Allenby.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.790
She must have contracted
DG cells from someone.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.510
There it is!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.230
The Berserker System receiver.

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:27.230
But it's right beside the cockpit!

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:31.200
The slightest mistake
and I'll injure Allenby.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.200
Am I capable of doing this?

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:40.560
I've no choice!

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.760
I'll hit it with an arrow!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:08.070
I don't have the soul of a martial
artist like Domon and the others.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.440
However...

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.860
...my feelings of wanting to save
people from the DG cells...

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.370
...are as strong as those
of anyone else...

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:16.820
And so...

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.410
...Ultimate Bull's Eye!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:24.400
Rising! Arrow!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.130
I did it!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.840
Wh-what?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:41.890
What happened to my
Devil Allenby?

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.650
It wasn't supposed to be this way.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.490
This isn't the way it was
supposed to be.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:53.820
In that case...

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.420
Reduce everything to ashes!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:09.100
Devil Gundam!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:12.760
That bastard!

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.170
He started random attacks...

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.390
You brothers are pathetic.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.140
And so, all the more reason...

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:27.150
...why you should forget him and
be the pilot of the Devil Gundam.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.980
Be that pilot, the core life unit...

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.480
...and you shall become one
with the Devil Gundam!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.030
Undefeated of the East!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:35.900
Why you...

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:41.580
Ever since Kyoji became a wreck
at the Guyana Highlands...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.870
...I've been looking for
a replacement core unit.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.790
I've been using the Gundam Fight
Finals to achieve this!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:48.790
What?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.710
Yes.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:53.170
The ultimate machine that is
the Devil Gundam...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:56.880
...requires the ultimate human
body to keep it alive eternally.

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.590
That's when I took notice of you...

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:01.300
...and had you battle the
world's top Fighters...

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.100
...to train you to be the best!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:03.810
In the process...

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:09.310
...you have become the ideal
ultimate core unit!

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:11.690
Domon!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.990
Now get inside!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.070
Get inside the Devil Gundam!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.950
Give up that perfect body of yours
to the Devil Gundam!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:24.990
Look.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:28.330
Thanks to you, your brother is
finished, barely able to breathe.

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.330
It's all your fault!

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.750
The least you could do is...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.000
...fill in for your brother
before he fades into nothingness!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:37.260
K-Kyoji...!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.220
Do...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:42.760
Domon...

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:44.520
No...

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:45.640
My consciousness...

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.850
My life exists only
as long as Kyoji's alive.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.600
Is this the end?

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.440
No.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.940
It's not over yet!

00:18:58.780 --> 00:18:59.820
Body of mine...

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:00.990
...please hold out!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:03.530
What?!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.040
Kyoji!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.500
What are you trying to do?!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.050
It's simple!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.340
I'm putting a stop to
the Devil Gundam!

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.880
That's crazy, Kyoji!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.840
Just shut up and watch!

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.430
He can't be serious!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.650
Kyoji!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:35.730
Domon!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.290
Kyoji!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.800
Kyoji!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.720
No!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.350
It's trying to absorb me!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:06.890
Domon! Do it!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.310
Destroy the Devil Gundam
along with me!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.310
Hurry!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.520
Aim at my body,
and crush this cockpit!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.360
I can't...

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:21.070
No! I just can't do it!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.900
Don't be such a cry-baby!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:27.740
Have you forgotten the Shuffle
Alliance crest on your hand?!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.740
The Shuffle Alliance crest?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:34.960
Remember your friends
who supported you...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.250
...so you can defeat this guy!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.170
If you're truly the man deserving
of the King of Hearts crest...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:45.270
...you mustn't let your emotions
get in the way of your objectives!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:52.180
Would you rather see this kind of
tragedy with Kyoji repeated?

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:55.520
Do it!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:59.730
Release us from the curse
of the Devil Gundam!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.480
Stop it, Domon!

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:05.000
Are you going to destroy your
brother with your own hands?!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.740
Please, Domon.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.540
Deliver the final blow
to the Devil Gundam!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:19.630
All right.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.250
No, Domon!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.390
Earth has no future
without the Devil Gundam!

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:33.350
K-Kyoji...

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:36.060
No!

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.810
Erupting...

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:48.870
...Sekiha Tenkyoken!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.750
Kyoji!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:03.000
Thanks.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.170
Domon.

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:09.760
Kyoji!

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.650
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:30.160
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:35.450
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:43.130
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:46.800
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:53.510
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:53.760 --> 00:23:01.060
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:05.610
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:09.200
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:16.660
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:25.500
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.390
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:39.270
Domon has finally defeated
the Devil Gundam.

00:23:39.270 --> 00:23:42.100
However, a furious Master Asia...

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.440
...risks the future of Earth
and humankind...

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:48.440
...by challenging Domon to a final
great Gundam Fight!

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:50.990
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:50.990 --> 00:23:55.870
Farewell, Master!
Master Asia's Last Breath.

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:59.880
Farewell, Master!
Master Asia's Last Breath

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:57.620
Ready! Go!
